WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Is God’s love only about my own

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.540
life?

3
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
Romans begins and ends with the gospel

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.000
reaching the nations.

5
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.320
Paul wants people everywhere to trust Christ

6
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.540
and honor his name.

7
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.120
In Romans fifteen,

8
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.120
Christ confirms God’s promises to Israel,

9
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.700
and the nations join in praising God

10
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.340
for mercy.

11
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.140
Then Paul asks the church in Rome

12
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.220
to help send him where Christ hasn’t

13
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:27.800
been named.

14
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.500
The love they’ve received opens their lives

15
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.940
to people they haven’t met.

16
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.200
You can share in that purpose through

17
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:34.620
prayer,

18
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:35.320
giving,

19
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.540
and helping your church send those who

20
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.180
preach Christ.

21
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.740
You’ve received mercy in Jesus.

22
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.000
Ask who still needs to hear about

23
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.200
him,

24
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.040
and take one faithful step

25
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:45.720
with his people.
